{
  "id": 1078,
  "name": "Get an mp4 attachment from Gmail to Google Drive",
  "description": "This simple workflow allows you to get an mp4 attachment from gmail email and then upload it to Google Drive to get attachment webview link.\n\n![workflow-screenshot](fileId:497)",
